%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: LocalizationTable_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fa88b033994461f419692bbaa512fc25, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 45166931968
    m_Localized: It's okay. Anyone can make mistakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232915234827
    m_Localized: Congratulations! You've completed all the exercises!! Now, shall
      we move on to the next chapter to become the safe walking king?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232915234826
    m_Localized: Congratulations on achieving the Safe Pedestrian King title in the
      Crossing the Alley chapter!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232915234825
    m_Localized: Congratulations on achieving the Safe Pedestrian King title in the
      Crossing the Crosswalk chapter!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232915234824
    m_Localized: 'You worked really hard~ It''s great that you''ve come this far!

      I''ll
      give you a pedestrian safety certificate for completing all the games!

      You''ll
      do even better next time!


      I''ll always be cheering you on~'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232915234823
    m_Localized: 'You worked hard~!

      You successfully completed the safety
      walking training and were able to receive a certificate!

      If you practice
      a little more, you too can challenge for the gold medal!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232915234822
    m_Localized: 'That was really great!

      A certificate of completion is given
      to the model pedestrian who has completed the safety walking training perfectly!

      I
      hope you will be able to walk safely in the future?


      Congratulations
      from the bottom of my heart!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232915234821
    m_Localized: 3...2...1...start!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232915234820
    m_Localized: 'It''s a game where you have to observe the people around you carefully!

      Find
      people walking dangerously and select them with the controller!

      If you
      find them correctly, your score will go up, and if you get them wrong, your
      score may go down!

      Let''s guess as many people as possible within the
      time limit! Are you ready?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232915234819
    m_Localized: 'Now you''re a blind spot expert~!

      Then, let''s go to the
      next location!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232915234818
    m_Localized: 'Now, let''s check where our friends who are still well hidden are.

      If
      the car had moved while our friends were hiding like this, it would have been
      really dangerous.

      Now you know how dangerous blind spots are, right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232915234817
    m_Localized: 'Good job! Let''s see how well you found your friends.

      Oh~
      You found them?! You did a great job!

      But... this friend hid really
      well, right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232915234816
    m_Localized: 'How hard is it to see the blind spot? Let''s experience it for
      yourself with a simple game.

      There will be mischievous friends hiding
      around the car!

      You have to point them out and find them!

      How
      many can you find in the given time?!

      So~ Are you ready?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040540
    m_Localized: "Blind spots are spaces that cannot be seen by the driver.\nThey
      are not visible through windows or mirrors\u2026\n\nIt is really dangerous
      if your friend is there.\nSo from now on, you will check it with your own eyes!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040539
    m_Localized: 'This time, I''ve prepared a very special experience!

      There
      is something called a blind spot in a car!

      Let''s see for yourself how
      hard it is to see!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040538
    m_Localized: Alleyway safe walking mission completed! Now you can cross the alleyway
      by yourself, right? Alright~ Shall we move on to the next lesson?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040537
    m_Localized: Good job! You're the best!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040536
    m_Localized: Take a look around!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040535
    m_Localized: Well then, let's go to the next place!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040534
    m_Localized: Now you're a blind spot expert!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040533
    m_Localized: Now you know how dangerous blind spots can be, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040532
    m_Localized: If the car had moved while my friends were hiding like this, it
      would have been really dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040531
    m_Localized: So now, let's check where our friends who have been hiding well
      until now are?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040530
    m_Localized: Oh~ You found it?! You did a great job! But... this guy was hiding
      really well, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040529
    m_Localized: Good job! Let's see how well you found your friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040528
    m_Localized: So~ are you ready?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040527
    m_Localized: How many people can you find within the given time?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040526
    m_Localized: There will be mischievous friends hiding around the car! You just
      have to point them out and find them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040525
    m_Localized: How about experiencing for yourself how poorly blind spots are seen
      with a simple game?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040524
    m_Localized: So from now on, you will see it with your own eyes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040523
    m_Localized: I can't see very well through the window or the mirror... It's really
      dangerous if my friend is there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040522
    m_Localized: Blind spots are areas that are not visible to the driver.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040521
    m_Localized: There's something called a blind spot in a car! Let's see for yourself
      how hard it is to see!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040520
    m_Localized: This time, we've prepared a very special experience!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040519
    m_Localized: Raise your hand and cross the street
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040518
    m_Localized: Look left and right before crossing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040517
    m_Localized: Cross the street safely!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040516
    m_Localized: Raise your hand and cross the street
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040515
    m_Localized: Look left and right before crossing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040514
    m_Localized: First of all, stop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040513
    m_Localized: Cross the street safely!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232911040512
    m_Localized: I have to go meet a friend
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846235
    m_Localized: Wait until the green light turns on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846234
    m_Localized: It's safe behind the yellow safety line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846233
    m_Localized: Raise your hand and cross the street.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846232
    m_Localized: Raise your hands high above your head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846231
    m_Localized: Look at both sides
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846230
    m_Localized: Let's get back on the road and try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846229
    m_Localized: How is it? Now you know what to do, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846228
    m_Localized: In places where you can't see ahead, always stop and check first.
      Okay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846227
    m_Localized: Look, this guy didn't just go out, he stopped first and looked left
      and right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846226
    m_Localized: Well then, shall we see what to do now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846225
    m_Localized: On a road where you can't see ahead, you must stop, check, and then
      move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846224
    m_Localized: If we can't see each other like we did just now, we could be in
      real trouble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846223
    m_Localized: "Hey, that guy\u2026 He\u2019s just walking without looking around."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846222
    m_Localized: So, if I get into the habit of looking at cars first, even if they
      can't see me, I'll be much safer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846221
    m_Localized: "Even if you recognize the car, if you think, \u2018It\u2019s okay
      now,\u2019 and just move on, it can be more dangerous."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846220
    m_Localized: In places like this where we are blocked by walls or cars, we can't
      see a car coming in advance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846219
    m_Localized: So before you go out into an alley or somewhere out of sight, you
      should definitely check once more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846218
    m_Localized: Just like now, cars can come out from the side you can't see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846217
    m_Localized: Let's get back on the road and try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846216
    m_Localized: How is it? Now you know what to do, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846215
    m_Localized: When passing a running vehicle, always move to a position where
      the driver can see you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846214
    m_Localized: Look, this guy, instead of moving to the back of the car, why don't
      you move to a position where the driver can see you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846213
    m_Localized: Well then, shall we see what to do now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846212
    m_Localized: That's why we should never stand in the blind spot of the driver's
      view.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846211
    m_Localized: If the car had gone a little further, we almost crashed! Isn't that
      incredibly dangerous?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846210
    m_Localized: There's a car blocking the location of my friend, so I can't see
      him at all from inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846209
    m_Localized: "We call those places \u2018blind spots.\u2019 That\u2019s why we
      have to be more careful in these places."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232906846208
    m_Localized: The same goes for people in cars. You might not be visible either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651936
    m_Localized: If you look here, can't you see the face of the person inside the
      car?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651935
    m_Localized: So if the car starts spinning or moving it can be really dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651934
    m_Localized: Actually, the driver might not have seen you there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651933
    m_Localized: Let's find out together why it was dangerous!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651932
    m_Localized: It's okay! You might not have known this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651931
    m_Localized: Look! If you do this, you can cross really safely!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651930
    m_Localized: First, look left and right...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651929
    m_Localized: Well then, shall we see what to do now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651928
    m_Localized: Wow! I'm really surprised! There can be cars coming even when the
      light is green!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651927
    m_Localized: Look, this guy just crosses the street as soon as the light turns
      green.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651926
    m_Localized: So, you must check first to see if the car has stopped before crossing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651925
    m_Localized: Even if the signal changes, there may be a car coming from the side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651924
    m_Localized: Sometimes cars miss the signal and just pass by, so we have to check
      first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651923
    m_Localized: Earlier, as soon as the green light turned on, you just crossed
      without looking at anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651922
    m_Localized: Let's get back on the road and try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651921
    m_Localized: How is it? Now you know what to do, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651920
    m_Localized: Then, people in cars can quickly recognize you and cross the street
      safely!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651919
    m_Localized: Isn't this guy raising his hand when he crosses?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651918
    m_Localized: Well then, shall we see what to do now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651917
    m_Localized: If you don't raise your hand, the driver may not be able to see
      you and it may be difficult to stop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651916
    m_Localized: Look, he's just crossing without even raising his hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651915
    m_Localized: So it's better for us to raise our hands first and let them know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651914
    m_Localized: People in cars sometimes have difficulty seeing in front or to the
      sides.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651913
    m_Localized: Well, then you have to be careful, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651912
    m_Localized: If you don't raise your hand, the people in the car might not see
      you and the car might just pass by!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651911
    m_Localized: You just walked away earlier, didn't you? You didn't even raise
      your hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651910
    m_Localized: Let's take a look at why what just happened was dangerous!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651909
    m_Localized: It's okay. Anyone can make mistakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651908
    m_Localized: Let's get back on the road and try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651907
    m_Localized: How is it? Now you know what to do, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651906
    m_Localized: Always remember that obeying the signal protects your safety.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651905
    m_Localized: When the light turns green, look left and right, raise your hand,
      and cross slowly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232902651904
    m_Localized: When the light is red, you must stop behind the yellow safety line
      like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457628
    m_Localized: Okay, this time I'll show you calmly how to be safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457627
    m_Localized: So when crossing the street, you must follow the signal and only
      cross on the designated road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457626
    m_Localized: But if we don't keep that in mind, it becomes too dangerous because
      neither the car nor I know what to do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457625
    m_Localized: Traffic lights and crosswalks are a promise to help cars know when
      and where people should cross.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457624
    m_Localized: Seriously, it could lead to a major accident in an instant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457623
    m_Localized: At times like this, the car can't see you, and it's almost impossible
      for the car to stop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457622
    m_Localized: You just now, did you cross the street when the light was red? Or,
      did you enter the street when it wasn't a crosswalk?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457621
    m_Localized: Why did you do something so dangerous? Even as a joke, you should
      never do something like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457620
    m_Localized: "Now that was\u2026 something I really shouldn\u2019t have done."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457619
    m_Localized: Let's get back on the road and try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457618
    m_Localized: How is it? Now you know what to do, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457617
    m_Localized: I'm sure you can do it. I believe in you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457616
    m_Localized: It's really simple! When you walk on the road, just walk straight
      to the end without stopping.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457615
    m_Localized: Okay, let's take a look at how to do it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457614
    m_Localized: If the flow becomes entangled like this, it can be dangerous for
      both cars and pedestrians.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457613
    m_Localized: If you stop suddenly like you just did, people behind you could
      be surprised and get hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457612
    m_Localized: So, on the road, the safest thing to do is to just keep walking
      without stopping.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457611
    m_Localized: If the flow gets tangled like that, a more dangerous situation can
      arise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457610
    m_Localized: If you stop, the car and the people following behind you may be
      confused and ask, "Huh? Why did you stop?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457609
    m_Localized: The car stopped because it thought you were going to keep walking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457608
    m_Localized: The road is too dangerous to just stand there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457607
    m_Localized: If you stop suddenly, the surroundings may become chaotic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457606
    m_Localized: Everyone was waiting for you to walk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457605
    m_Localized: Just now, you were crossing the street and suddenly stopped in the
      middle of the street?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457604
    m_Localized: Let's take a look at why what just happened was dangerous!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457603
    m_Localized: It's okay. Anyone can make mistakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457602
    m_Localized: Let's get back on the road and try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457601
    m_Localized: How is it? Now you know what to do, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232898457600
    m_Localized: If you wait like this and then cross, you can cross the road safely!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263318
    m_Localized: Can you see this guy stopping when the light flashes and waiting
      until the next signal?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263317
    m_Localized: Well then, shall we see what to do now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263316
    m_Localized: If you don't follow the rules, that kind of situation will happen!
      So you have to follow them! That's the only way to be truly safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263315
    m_Localized: Ahh! I knew it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263314
    m_Localized: Look, it's blinking right now, but if you just cross it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263313
    m_Localized: If you cross at this time, you may end up stopped in the middle
      of the road, or a car may come running.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263312
    m_Localized: If the green light is blinking, it means it will soon turn red.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263311
    m_Localized: At that moment, it is too dangerous to cross because it means the
      signal will change soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263310
    m_Localized: You started crossing when the green light started blinking, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263309
    m_Localized: Let's take a look at why what just happened was dangerous!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263308
    m_Localized: It's okay. Anyone can make mistakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263307
    m_Localized: Let's get back on the road and try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263306
    m_Localized: How is it? Now you know what to do, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263305
    m_Localized: This way, the driver can see you better, so it's much safer!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263304
    m_Localized: Look, this guy is waiting just inside the yellow line!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263303
    m_Localized: Well then, let's take a look at how to be safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263302
    m_Localized: A car might actually hit you if it comes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263301
    m_Localized: "Look, if you go too far forward like that\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263300
    m_Localized: And if you go too far forward, you run the risk of hitting a car.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263299
    m_Localized: The reason there are safety lines is to make it easier for drivers
      to see us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263298
    m_Localized: That line is a stop sign. Ignoring it could lead to a really big
      accident.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263297
    m_Localized: The reason your actions were dangerous just now was because you
      crossed the yellow line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4232894263296
    m_Localized: Let's take a look together at why what just happened was dangerous!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
